WEBVTT

00:06.214 --> 00:07.215
A Man-eater.

00:08.925 --> 00:10.552
Great. Better tell everyone quickly!

00:12.595 --> 00:14.305
-Captain!
-Don't barge in--

00:14.389 --> 00:16.850
A Man-eater's attacking the ship!
We need to go faster!

00:16.933 --> 00:18.184
What'd you say?

00:18.977 --> 00:20.603
Sis, it's here!

00:24.274 --> 00:25.233
Eat this!

00:30.030 --> 00:31.156
Take that!

00:37.370 --> 00:38.538
Seriously?

01:16.659 --> 01:18.161
TENGOKU-DAIMAKYO

01:18.995 --> 01:20.205
TENGOKU-DAIMAKYO

02:18.722 --> 02:21.182
No one saw you, right?

02:21.766 --> 02:22.767
Yup.

02:22.851 --> 02:26.062
Then let's go! To see the babies!

02:36.281 --> 02:37.365
Here it is!

02:38.074 --> 02:39.075
Here?

02:39.868 --> 02:41.327
-Follow me.
-Huh?

02:41.870 --> 02:42.871
What?

02:50.170 --> 02:51.588
We're going in through here!

03:02.390 --> 03:04.267
How am I supposed to do that?

03:04.351 --> 03:05.643
KUKU

03:15.236 --> 03:16.863
Hey, did you hear that noise?

03:17.447 --> 03:19.074
I think so.

03:19.157 --> 03:21.868
-Okay, watch this!
-Quit it, you'll get hurt.

03:21.951 --> 03:23.495
Here goes.

03:25.455 --> 03:27.499
<i>Abnormal behavior detected.</i>

03:27.582 --> 03:30.126
Taka's always full of energy.

03:32.754 --> 03:35.924
<i>Close contact</i>
<i>of more than ten seconds confirmed.</i>

03:36.007 --> 03:37.884
Nanaki and Iwa again?

03:37.967 --> 03:41.096
I wonder what possessed them
to kiss each other.

03:41.179 --> 03:43.014
It's quite strange.

03:43.098 --> 03:45.684
We've never taught them that behavior.

03:45.767 --> 03:46.893
-Huh?
-Huh?

03:46.976 --> 03:49.896
<i>Possible deterioration in health detected.</i>

03:49.979 --> 03:52.774
Medical team,
confirm Tarao's condition immediately.

03:53.358 --> 03:55.110
<i>The nurse is currently with him.</i>

03:55.193 --> 03:56.528
We're on our way.

03:56.611 --> 03:58.321
Here, stick onto the wall.

03:59.364 --> 04:01.741
Okay. Go up.

04:03.326 --> 04:05.495
What a good idea, Tokio!

04:05.578 --> 04:07.997
This was Taka's idea.

04:12.961 --> 04:15.088
Let's go, Tokio!

04:19.926 --> 04:21.386
Let's look for it.

04:22.012 --> 04:23.847
Okay then…

04:24.848 --> 04:26.266
Tokio!

04:26.850 --> 04:27.976
Hurry up.

04:28.059 --> 04:29.060
Right.

04:31.354 --> 04:35.608
<i>Am I going outside of the outside?</i>

04:42.699 --> 04:44.159
We're dead if it gets inside!

04:45.285 --> 04:47.620
Can't you shoot it away again?

04:47.704 --> 04:51.249
Then we can go and close all of the doors.

04:51.332 --> 04:54.044
I can't. I'm out of bullets.

04:54.753 --> 04:57.756
Don't know if the ship's
lopsided or rusted,

04:57.839 --> 04:59.966
but there's a door that won't budge.

05:00.467 --> 05:03.470
Then the only thing we can do
is barricade ourselves in here.

05:03.553 --> 05:05.555
How long until we reach the shore?

05:05.638 --> 05:07.640
Thirty minutes at top speed.

05:08.224 --> 05:09.434
Will it hold?

05:13.563 --> 05:15.315
Probably not.

05:17.108 --> 05:18.360
Sis.

05:18.443 --> 05:23.782
From what I've seen,
the fish uses those suction cup hands

05:23.865 --> 05:28.661
and a suit of water covering its body
as a lubricant to move on land.

05:29.662 --> 05:32.082
It relies on the water suit to attack
and move around.

05:33.124 --> 05:35.168
Where's the best place to fight it?

05:35.752 --> 05:38.296
Somewhere it can't get water. On land?

05:39.130 --> 05:41.341
Better if it's somewhere like a maze.

05:41.841 --> 05:43.927
Since it attacks and moves
only in straight lines.

05:45.136 --> 05:46.346
We'll fight it inside the ship.

05:46.429 --> 05:47.847
Inside the ship?

05:48.431 --> 05:51.351
Hey! There's a door downstairs, right?

05:51.434 --> 05:53.019
Give me the key.

05:53.103 --> 05:54.020
DO NOT ENTER

05:54.104 --> 05:55.146
Why?

05:55.230 --> 05:56.940
If you don't want to die, give it to me!

05:57.023 --> 05:59.025
-It ain't locked!
-Eh?

05:59.693 --> 06:01.861
Ain't never been locked.

06:02.445 --> 06:03.905
He said it ain't locked.

06:05.156 --> 06:06.199
Okay.

06:07.784 --> 06:09.411
Sis, wait!

06:09.494 --> 06:11.496
How are we going to fight
without the Kiru-Beam?

06:12.247 --> 06:13.289
We have the Maru-Touch.

06:16.042 --> 06:17.043
And that is?

06:18.294 --> 06:20.463
-You're going to kill it by touching it.
-What?

06:23.383 --> 06:26.052
Wait, you got no plan?

06:30.682 --> 06:34.185
Hey! Over here! Come and get me!

06:40.025 --> 06:43.445
Here-- Here it comes!

06:44.779 --> 06:46.031
Scary!

06:49.367 --> 06:51.244
Damn, the boxes!

06:51.327 --> 06:52.746
Hurry and climb over!

07:06.426 --> 07:08.136
What an idiot! Dumb shot!

07:09.971 --> 07:11.222
Sis, it's open!

07:12.265 --> 07:15.727
If you don't open both sides,
the fish can't get in!

07:16.519 --> 07:17.687
It doesn't need to come in!

07:17.771 --> 07:20.190
-Yes, it does!
-Huh?

07:22.317 --> 07:23.818
It's all boxes here too.

07:23.902 --> 07:25.195
Just get over there!

07:25.779 --> 07:29.282
Damn! This isn't the best situation
to come up with a plan!

07:38.583 --> 07:39.584
A door!

07:40.960 --> 07:44.923
The door won't open. No way!

07:52.305 --> 07:54.557
Maru, you don't need to open it.

07:55.975 --> 07:58.269
Sis, it's no good. It won't open.

07:58.770 --> 08:01.314
-I said it's okay.
-Why?

08:07.821 --> 08:09.239
What's happening to it?

08:10.573 --> 08:14.035
There should've been a ton of marijuana
on this ship,

08:14.619 --> 08:17.205
but there were only vegetables upstairs.

08:18.331 --> 08:23.378
I thought there'd be
boxes of marijuana in this locked room.

08:24.045 --> 08:28.425
With all the boxes and dried marijuana
sucking up the water,

08:30.010 --> 08:32.303
this guy's just a fish out of water.

08:37.934 --> 08:38.935
We won.

08:43.940 --> 08:46.651
Looks fine. Go kill it.

08:47.318 --> 08:49.821
Beating it without the Kiru-Beam…

08:49.904 --> 08:52.907
You can't just look at the opponent
in these situations.

08:53.616 --> 08:57.787
You'll win if you stay calm
and look at your surroundings.

09:00.373 --> 09:02.250
That's how I've survived.

09:04.544 --> 09:06.087
Anyway, it's horrible.

09:07.547 --> 09:11.634
I can live with "Kiru-Beam,"
but "Maru-Touch" is just awful.

09:12.135 --> 09:15.638
-What're you talking about?
-The stupid way you name things!

09:18.975 --> 09:21.436
It's pitch black now.

09:21.519 --> 09:23.521
We're almost there. See?

09:27.942 --> 09:29.778
Okay. Nobody's around.

09:29.861 --> 09:31.446
Someone's in there sometimes?

09:31.946 --> 09:35.533
The Director, and adults I've never met.

09:42.874 --> 09:46.795
Are we outside the school? Inside?

09:46.878 --> 09:47.879
Look!

09:48.880 --> 09:50.507
Real live babies.

09:57.847 --> 09:58.973
Those are…

09:59.974 --> 10:00.975
babies?

10:25.792 --> 10:27.794
<i>Intruder detected.</i>

10:28.378 --> 10:30.213
-<i>Intruder detected.</i>
-Tokio!

10:30.296 --> 10:32.882
<i>The sanctum. The sanctum.</i>

10:41.975 --> 10:44.978
<i>Intruder detected. Intruder detected.</i>

10:45.061 --> 10:46.062
INCUBATOR ROOM 1

10:46.146 --> 10:47.272
<i>The sanctum.</i>

10:47.939 --> 10:49.315
What is this alert?

10:49.399 --> 10:50.400
SANCTUM

10:50.483 --> 10:52.235
I'm not sure.
It's my first time hearing it.

10:52.318 --> 10:54.571
-It said intruder.
-First, let's go in and see.

11:13.465 --> 11:14.758
What is this fuss?

11:16.259 --> 11:18.094
There was an intruder alert here!

11:19.387 --> 11:21.389
I also heard it.

11:21.473 --> 11:23.475
We will confirm it right now.

11:24.142 --> 11:27.479
-<i>Monitor Room.</i>
-We're looking into it, but…

11:27.562 --> 11:30.106
There's no sign of any intruder.

11:30.774 --> 11:34.611
We'll continue our search,
but it's most likely an error.

11:36.946 --> 11:38.948
They didn't find us?

11:39.032 --> 11:41.534
Tokio! Come on!

11:53.421 --> 11:54.464
Hurry.

11:57.759 --> 11:58.760
Tokio!

12:07.102 --> 12:10.605
To-ki-o.

12:14.317 --> 12:15.568
Okay, Mina.

12:17.529 --> 12:18.530
<i>Yes.</i>

12:19.197 --> 12:23.034
Do you know anything about that alert?

12:23.118 --> 12:25.537
Isn't this place like a part of your body?

12:26.037 --> 12:30.375
<i>If a human had a health inspection,</i>

12:30.458 --> 12:33.586
<i>and received a report</i>
<i>for "further examination required,"</i>

12:33.670 --> 12:38.341
<i>could that human identify where there was</i>
<i>something wrong in their body?</i>

12:38.967 --> 12:42.178
I surrender, Mina. You win.

12:50.186 --> 12:51.396
Hold up!

12:52.397 --> 12:58.028
You buggers! Where are you going
after messing up our cargo?

13:01.239 --> 13:04.284
If you hadn't been there,
the whole ship would've been lost.

13:05.452 --> 13:07.704
You're our saviors. Thank you!

13:08.747 --> 13:11.124
This is payment
for the monster extermination.

13:11.207 --> 13:14.294
We would've been killed
if we hadn't fought back,

13:14.794 --> 13:16.755
so we can't take this.

13:16.838 --> 13:20.884
In exchange, tell us about this area.

13:21.384 --> 13:22.469
Well…

13:25.847 --> 13:28.975
If you keep walking down this big road,

13:29.059 --> 13:31.227
you'll see a kind of town.

13:31.728 --> 13:32.854
Really?

13:32.937 --> 13:36.566
Oh, yeah. Do you know anything
about this logo?

13:38.985 --> 13:42.822
Logos using birds
have been around for ages,

13:43.323 --> 13:45.950
so they all look the same to me.

13:46.034 --> 13:48.036
-I see.
-That logo!

13:48.119 --> 13:49.245
You know it?

13:49.829 --> 13:50.872
It's…

13:52.499 --> 13:53.792
Mitsuba's logo.

13:53.875 --> 13:55.001
Mitsuba?

13:55.085 --> 13:57.003
Yeah, I'm sure of it.

13:57.087 --> 14:00.632
You'll find a destroyed Mitsuba
along this road.

14:01.966 --> 14:03.051
Thanks!

14:04.260 --> 14:08.056
Hey, do you want to be our bodyguards?

14:08.139 --> 14:10.975
We're busy right now, but one day!

14:12.727 --> 14:16.147
Damn brats, turning down my bro's offer.

14:16.648 --> 14:18.817
They've got skills and character.

14:18.900 --> 14:21.111
I'd like to see them again
if the chance comes.

14:21.611 --> 14:23.530
They're good kids.

14:28.785 --> 14:31.454
HOME CENTER

14:32.872 --> 14:37.627
Geez, that gangster. Getting my hopes up.

14:39.212 --> 14:40.547
There's nothing here.

14:41.089 --> 14:43.216
-Sis!
-Huh?

14:43.299 --> 14:45.593
I found something we could eat!

14:45.677 --> 14:49.389
Good job! Where was it?

14:49.472 --> 14:52.017
It was in a bag under some shelves.

14:52.684 --> 14:55.478
I also found an umbrella.
Should we go find the town?

14:55.562 --> 15:00.025
Nah, there's still time until sunrise.
Let's sleep here.

15:01.026 --> 15:02.027
HAYASE YOUKAN

15:02.110 --> 15:03.111
Youkan.

15:03.695 --> 15:06.573
Is this edible?

15:09.993 --> 15:11.453
It's sweet!

15:11.536 --> 15:14.372
You-kan! So you-can eat it!

15:23.089 --> 15:25.133
So good! This is so good!

15:25.216 --> 15:26.259
It's hot!

15:26.885 --> 15:29.137
We still have the ingredients,
so I can make it again.

15:29.220 --> 15:30.472
Let's give it a name.

15:32.140 --> 15:35.143
Since it's made with youkan and bread,

15:35.226 --> 15:36.436
how about "Bread-Kan Soup"?

15:36.519 --> 15:39.773
Right, the way you name things
is the worst.

15:39.856 --> 15:43.985
You're the one who said
"you-can eat" the youkan!

15:44.069 --> 15:47.614
Whatever its name, it's so good!
How many more times can you make it?

15:47.697 --> 15:48.782
Just once.

15:48.865 --> 15:50.492
Only once…

15:55.789 --> 15:57.749
But that was unexpected.

15:57.832 --> 16:00.752
The rain? Yeah, it came out of nowhere.

16:00.835 --> 16:02.128
No.

16:03.755 --> 16:04.881
Mitsuba.

16:06.549 --> 16:07.759
You're right.

16:08.343 --> 16:10.470
What did he mean "I'm sure of it"?

16:11.221 --> 16:14.599
It doesn't look like it at all.
Idiot gangsters.

16:14.683 --> 16:15.892
MITSUBA
HOME CENTER

16:27.737 --> 16:29.155
It's gone.

16:29.239 --> 16:33.618
It should be here between these two dates.

16:33.702 --> 16:36.538
I can't even remember it clearly.

16:38.456 --> 16:40.291
I should've burned it

16:40.375 --> 16:44.379
into the memory of my eyelids.

16:46.965 --> 16:50.218
-Okay! Let's play my new game!
-Mimihime.

16:50.301 --> 16:52.095
The only one who can play it is Taka.

16:52.178 --> 16:53.013
Hey.

16:53.096 --> 16:54.764
-Just try it.
-I'm going to the pool.

16:55.974 --> 16:57.017
Picture?

16:57.600 --> 17:00.812
I don't remember sending you
any messages recently.

17:01.312 --> 17:03.106
I'd talk to you directly
if I needed anything.

17:03.690 --> 17:05.859
-I see.
-What kind of picture was it?

17:05.942 --> 17:08.486
No-- That's not important.

17:08.987 --> 17:09.988
Actually…

17:11.614 --> 17:15.410
You might think I'm weird for saying this.

17:17.037 --> 17:19.998
Every time I look at you,

17:20.832 --> 17:22.876
I get these wild urges.

17:23.376 --> 17:24.919
What do you mean?

17:25.503 --> 17:27.380
Can you be more specific?

17:27.464 --> 17:29.924
Specific…

17:31.301 --> 17:32.761
I want to…

17:34.554 --> 17:36.765
keep you in my room.

17:37.557 --> 17:39.601
I don't mind if it's for a short while.

17:40.101 --> 17:41.102
And what else?

17:44.314 --> 17:47.609
Take off your clothes and touch you.

17:48.193 --> 17:49.194
To touch you,

17:49.778 --> 17:53.448
and lick… lick you.

17:55.075 --> 17:56.618
You want to eat me?

17:56.701 --> 18:00.121
No! It's different from eating.

18:00.622 --> 18:02.165
You'll disappear if I eat you.

18:02.248 --> 18:04.709
Do you want to cut me up
and stab me with needles?

18:04.793 --> 18:06.211
No way!

18:30.318 --> 18:33.071
Hurry and get better, Tarao.

18:33.738 --> 18:35.365
Let's play together again.

18:35.865 --> 18:36.991
Tokio…

18:40.453 --> 18:43.873
It's okay. It's not an infectious disease.

18:43.957 --> 18:46.251
That's not what I meant.

18:47.711 --> 18:48.837
Sorry.

18:50.922 --> 18:51.965
Tokio.

19:00.974 --> 19:01.975
Tokio!

19:17.741 --> 19:18.742
Tokio!

19:20.452 --> 19:21.578
What's wrong?

19:22.203 --> 19:23.204
Kona.

19:29.002 --> 19:30.086
Have you calmed down?

19:30.754 --> 19:31.755
Yeah.

19:33.548 --> 19:36.718
Everyone's acting weird these days.

19:39.554 --> 19:42.223
It's so scary.

19:45.518 --> 19:47.395
It's not something to be scared of.

19:49.356 --> 19:53.068
It's natural to fall in love with someone.

19:54.194 --> 20:00.075
One day, you'll also want to touch,
and be touched by someone.

20:00.784 --> 20:02.869
There's no need to be confused by that.

20:07.332 --> 20:08.333
Then--

20:09.834 --> 20:12.045
If that's the case…

20:15.423 --> 20:16.966
I'd like it to be Kona.

20:25.767 --> 20:27.143
I want it to be you too.

20:50.750 --> 20:51.876
<i>Tokio.</i>

20:53.128 --> 20:56.715
<i>This announcement is made</i>
<i>only to your room.</i>

20:57.841 --> 21:01.094
-<i>Tarao's condition has suddenly changed.</i>
-What?

21:01.177 --> 21:03.471
<i>Tarao wants to speak with you.</i>

21:04.264 --> 21:06.808
<i>Come to the treatment room</i>
<i>as soon as possible.</i>

21:08.685 --> 21:09.936
Tarao!

21:11.438 --> 21:14.607
Leave us alone.

21:14.691 --> 21:17.819
Are you okay? Hang in there, Tarao!

21:18.611 --> 21:21.698
We'll be outside.
Call us if anything happens.

21:24.743 --> 21:25.744
Tarao.

21:26.578 --> 21:28.079
Sorry.

21:28.621 --> 21:32.417
It's okay. Hold my hand.

21:37.047 --> 21:38.673
I'm sorry about earlier.

21:39.174 --> 21:41.968
I didn't think about your feelings.

21:42.052 --> 21:43.762
Forget about that.

21:47.557 --> 21:50.018
I'm not going to get better.

21:50.101 --> 21:52.270
Don't say that!

21:53.813 --> 21:56.149
Listen to me, Tokio.

21:57.400 --> 21:58.401
You need to…

22:00.487 --> 22:01.488
run away.

22:04.240 --> 22:05.492
This place is…

22:07.327 --> 22:08.328
dangerous.
